{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月20日，騰訊混元宣佈正式開源Hy4模型，並同步發佈Hy4 System Card，披露模型的安全評估方法、測試結果及已知風險。開發者目前可通過GitHub、Hugging Face、ModelScope和GitCode獲取相關模型並進行部署。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587258.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.301992+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:07:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_hash":"ff39339871e920ebeafca0e9be4afb87c73fd031a1204875335a35af64f8f135","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}